# MR4 (SOFT, quad): the four-chip mesh-read probe that DECIDES MR (one mesh-level verify readback) and 2a (the joined quad reads) of the fusion plan. The fabric action opens the served (1, 4) mesh once and runs optimisation/ttnn-op/mr_probe's arms over four chips (scripts/ci/tp4_mr_probe.py): the served loop
# (every chip's ids part then every chip's values part: 2 x 4 blocking reads), two mesh-level reads, ONE joined word tensor read once, a non-blocking per-chip read with one synchronise, and the same loop and mesh read on a 32 x 32 tile (the quad draft's output size class). Host-side reads only: nothing is computed on the cards.
# READ: the 'MR_PROBE verdict=...' line: GO (the mesh read beats the served loop by a quarter or more AND the joined word read beats the two mesh reads), MESH-ONLY (only the two mesh reads win), NO-GO, NOT-MEASURED (the mesh did not open: the error text is there). It replaces the card-M MR job as the decision (that one reads INCONCLUSIVE-SINGLE-CHIP by construction and gives the floor of one read); put the served loop's 'serial_us' beside the reads_ms of the [PACKED-HOSTGAP-VERIFY] lines of T2, T5 or P1 (the stack's own reads: the w2 profiles run the shard readback path, QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T1=1 baked in the image and no QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T1_SKIP).
# Runs right after X0 (the cards are freshly reset); it holds the cards for minutes and closes the mesh itself. NO agentstop, NO agentstart. Duration (estimate): 20 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/w2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/w2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/w2 commit; every later job serves that one image. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset fabric
C2_FABRIC_PROBE=mr
C2_FABRIC=FABRIC_1D
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4
